ic derivation of every scoped Section 10.1-10.4 constraint, now on a Story base replayed onto current trunk."\nspawn agent resolution: Agent selection: codex via explicit_override (preferred_agentic_system: exclusive[codex], config: spawn.preferred_agentic_system)\nspawn launch composition: empty; contract=agents-infra.child-launch-composition; provider=codex; schema=1; producer=v1.6.1; diagnostic=launch_composition_empty; no project MCP servers enabled\nspawn queued: [implementer] developer (codex) (run=RUN-260831-f460e4, max_parallel=20)\nspawn run RUN-260831-a5b476 cancelled by operator; operator action required; reason: Would hit the same base authority mismatch; refreshing the Story base first.\nspawn run started: [implementer] developer (codex) (run=RUN-260831-f460e4)\nagent completed: [implementer] developer (codex) (exit=-1)\nspawn run completed: codex (run=RUN-260831-f460e4, pid=20873, exit=-1)\nSTORY-260830-2wdm5e base refresh: the Story branch was replayed onto trunk ad7275181ca8 before this final-leaf producer started; the reviewed trunk OID is ad7275181ca8\nspawn workload selection: class=implementation source=derived policy=spawn.workload_classes pair=codex/gpt-5.6-sol/high pair_source=explicit match=recommended_rank_1 snapshot=sha256:f7130ab6b2ae6c4bf7bde632137d1eb646cbd3be7f4039acc56d0cf5f965b005 rationale="Following rank-1 recommendation: systematic derivation of every scoped Section 10.1-10.4 constraint, on a base that can now replay onto trunk."\nspawn agent resolution: Agent selection: codex via explicit_override (preferred_agentic_system: exclusive[codex], config: spawn.preferred_agentic_system)\nspawn launch composition: empty; contract=agents-infra.child-launch-composition; provider=codex; schema=1; producer=v1.6.1; diagnostic=launch_composition_empty; no project MCP servers enabled\nspawn queued: [implementer] developer (codex) (run=RUN-260831-8e0a72, max_parallel=20)\nspawn run RUN-260831-f460e4 cancelled by operator; operator action required; reason: Base still stale after conflicted replay; resolving the config collision on trunk first.\nspawn run started: [implementer] developer (codex) (run=RUN-260831-8e0a72)\nRevision 5 recovered the systematic Section 10.1-10.4 candidate after stale-base CR failure/rebase loss, bound CR rev3 to reviewed tree 93e6d212 and replayed the original rev4 patch stream over current Story HEAD 828d633. Independent pinned-SPEC audit fixed three over-refusals: bare strings no longer gain an undeclared non-empty bound, Section 17.3 schema_id remains a UTF-8 string, and sanitized absolute Git URLs no longer gain an undeclared path bound. Both public identity entries prove the positive boundaries. Direct gates all exited 0: focused and precision regressions, cross-platform golden, full/verbose/coverage/full-race, focused race/coverage (scalar 90.1%, canonicaljson 81.4%), four fixed-100x fuzz targets, fuzz config wiring, scoped tracecheck assigned_scopes=6, catalog, build, vet, Linux/Windows test cross-compiles and full builds, format, diff, and board validate. Board validate emitted 262 inherited MISSING_ACTIVITY diagnostics and did not list this task. Evidence: TASK-260830-8x76g1_rework-rev5-results.md, TASK-260830-8x76g1_rework-rev5-logbook.md, TASK-260830-8x76g1_rework-rev5-validation-logs.tar.gz, updated TASK-260830-8x76g1_constraint-enumeration.md.\nagent completed: [implementer] developer (codex) (exit=0)\nspawn run completed: codex (run=RUN-260831-8e0a72, pid=30981, exit=0)\nspawn autonomous recovery: run RUN-260831-8e0a72 queued successor RUN-260831-1c6191 (attempt 1/3, model=gpt-5.6-sol): Change Request construction for TASK-260830-8x76g1 failed: change_request_base_authority_mismatch: the STORY-260830-2wdm5e candidate provenance disagrees (selected=ad7275181ca82fc3fa29544e3893923a92d7b9d5 current=ad7275181ca82fc3fa29544e3893923a92d7b9d5 checkpoint=fb61f3d6f5a71377de3a4938603e6cc9965cfd16 branch=828d63321a74bb6be1b322eebc5ea64794d7d914 head=828d63321a74bb6be1b322eebc5e